<main class="mf-reader-page">
  <div class="mf-reader-shell">
    <header class="mf-reader-header">
      <a class="mf-reader-back" href="{{toc_url}}">
        <span class="icon-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>{{site_title}}</span>
      </a>
      <a class="mf-reader-login" href="/admin/">登录</a>
    </header>

    <article class="mf-reader-content">
      <header class="mf-reader-chapter-head">
        <h1>{{#tcmTitleHtml}}{{{tcmTitleHtml}}}{{/tcmTitleHtml}}{{^tcmTitleHtml}}{{items.0.title}}{{/tcmTitleHtml}}</h1>
        <div class="mf-reader-meta">
          {{#items.0._microfeed.volume}}<span>{{items.0._microfeed.volume}}</span>{{/items.0._microfeed.volume}}
          {{#items.0._microfeed.wordCount}}<span>本章字数：{{items.0._microfeed.wordCount}}字</span>{{/items.0._microfeed.wordCount}}
          <time data-microfeed-date-ms="{{items.0._microfeed.date_published_ms}}">{{items.0._microfeed.date_published_short}}</time>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="mf-reading-controls" data-mf-reading-controls hidden>
        <div class="mf-reading-group" role="group" aria-label="字号">
          <button type="button" data-mf-font="small">小</button>
          <button type="button" data-mf-font="medium">中</button>
          <button type="button" data-mf-font="large">大</button>
        </div>
        <div class="mf-reading-group" role="group" aria-label="背景">
          <button type="button" data-mf-paper="default">默认</button>
          <button type="button" data-mf-paper="sepia">米黄</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      {{#items.0.image}}
      <div class="mb-4"><img src="{{items.0.image}}" width="250" height="250" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div>
      {{/items.0.image}}

      {{#items.0._microfeed.is_audio}}
      <div class="text-sm mb-4">收听：</div>
      {{#items.0.attachments}}
      <audio controls preload="metadata" class="w-full"><source src="{{url}}" type="{{mime_type}}"/>您的浏览器不支持音频播放。</audio>
      {{/items.0.attachments}}
      {{/items.0._microfeed.is_audio}}

      {{#items.0._microfeed.is_video}}
      <div class="text-sm mb-4">观看：</div>
      {{#items.0.attachments}}
      <video controls preload="metadata" class="w-full"><source src="{{url}}" type="{{mime_type}}"/>您的浏览器不支持视频播放。</video>
      {{/items.0.attachments}}
      {{/items.0._microfeed.is_video}}

      <div class="mf-reader-body mf-rich-content">
        {{#items.0.content_html}}{{{items.0.content_html}}}{{/items.0.content_html}}
        {{^items.0.content_html}}{{#items.0.content_text}}<p>{{items.0.content_text}}</p>{{/items.0.content_text}}{{/items.0.content_html}}
      </div>

      {{! 阅读导航只保留一个「返回」。上一章 / 下一章 / 三段式目录曾经由阅读页
          `src/pages/i/[slug]/index.astro` 拉「整本书的章节列表」算出，那两个查询
          在 D1 上要步进全书条目（非 TCM 约 2,965 行、TCM 约 6,091 行）却只是为了
          确定当前章的位置，在每天 5,000,000 行读的免费额度下是单页最贵的一笔。
          排序键是 `COALESCE(json_extract(data,'$._microfeed.no'),
          CAST(json_extract(data,'$._microfeed.section') AS TEXT))`，没有任何索引
          能覆盖它（F4 已实测 TEMP B-TREE 消不掉），所以「便宜地只取两个邻居」
          这条路不存在。
          现在 `toc_url` 指向书页并带上 `#mf-toc-<当前条目 id>`——书页按同一约定
          给每个目录行（条文）设了 `id="mf-toc-<条文 id>"`，给每个篇章分组标题
          （`<h3 class="mf-volume-heading">`）设了 `id="mf-toc-<篇章 id>"`，于是
          「返回」直接落在读者刚才点开的那一行（或那一篇章）上
          （见 `web-feed.mustache` 与 `web-body-end.mustache` 的收尾滚动）。}}
      <nav class="mf-reader-nav" aria-label="阅读导航">
        <a href="{{toc_url}}" class="mf-reader-return">
          <span class="icon-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>返回</span>
        </a>
      </nav>

    </article>

    <aside class="mf-reader-tools" aria-label="阅读工具">
      {{! 加书架 and 领红包 were prototype-only affordances: neither has a handler
          anywhere in the repo (no bookshelf or red-packet feature exists), so they
          rendered as buttons that did nothing. Only the working tools remain. The
          ☰目录 toggle was removed with the bottom TOC drawer it opened — the 目录
          link above goes to the book page, which lists every chapter. }}
      <button class="mf-reader-tool" type="button" data-mf-reader-night><span aria-hidden="true">◐</span><small>夜间</small></button>
      <button class="mf-reader-tool" type="button" data-mf-font="large"><span aria-hidden="true">A</span><small>字号</small></button>
    </aside>
  </div>
  {{#tcm_marker_runtime}}{{{tcm_marker_runtime}}}{{/tcm_marker_runtime}}
</main>
